        "country_code": "ru",
        "front_dist_km": null,
        "text": "The Russian monthly rate of advance in July 2026 is higher than the rate of advance in June 2026 but is still insufficient to seize the remainder of Donetsk Oblast by Putin’s newly set deadline of December 31, 2026.[6] It remains highly unlikely that Russian forces will be able to seize the Fortress Belt or the rest of Donbas any time soon, if at all.",
