        "country_code": "ua",
        "front_dist_km": null,
        "text": "Russian milbloggers acknowledged on August 7 that Ukrainian forces control part of central Muravka (northeast of Novopavlivka).[44] Geolocated footage published on August 6 shows Ukrainian forces striking a Russian position north of Novomykolaivka (northeast of Novopavlivka), after what ISW assesses was a Russian infiltration mission.[45] Ukrainian forces recently advanced northeast of Oleksandrivka.",
